From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:34:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] unit: test where the DHCP server sends its OFFER and ACK

test-dhcp-server runs the real gdhcp server and option code on the
loopback interface. The linker's --wrap swaps its three socket helpers:
dhcp_l3_socket() hands out one end of a socketpair, the test queues
client packets for dhcp_recv_l3_packet(), and dhcp_send_raw_packet()
records the destination.

It checks RFC 2131 4.1: with no broadcast bit and no address yet, the
OFFER and ACK go to yiaddr and the client's hardware address; with the
broadcast bit, to the broadcast addresses; a renewing client gets the
ACK at ciaddr. Before "gdhcp: unicast OFFER and ACK as RFC 2131 asks"
the first case fails, the OFFER going to 255.255.255.255.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 Makefile.am             |  15 +++
 unit/test-dhcp-server.c | 250 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 265 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 unit/test-dhcp-server.c

diff --git a/Makefile.am b/Makefile.am
index 203b251..f145c7d 100644
--- a/Makefile.am
+++ b/Makefile.am
@@ -326,6 +326,21 @@ LOG_DRIVER = env AM_TAP_AWK='$(AWK)' $(SHELL) \
 
 TESTS = unit/test-ippool
 
+noinst_PROGRAMS += unit/test-dhcp-server
+
+# The server runs for real on the loopback interface; only its socket
+# helpers are swapped for the test's own (see unit/test-dhcp-server.c).
+unit_test_dhcp_server_SOURCES = $(backtrace_sources) src/log.c \
+				src/util.c gdhcp/gdhcp.h gdhcp/common.h \
+				gdhcp/common.c gdhcp/server.c \
+				gdhcp/unaligned.h unit/test-dhcp-server.c
+unit_test_dhcp_server_LDADD = @GLIB_LIBS@ -ldl
+unit_test_dhcp_server_LDFLAGS = -Wl,--wrap=dhcp_l3_socket \
+				-Wl,--wrap=dhcp_recv_l3_packet \
+				-Wl,--wrap=dhcp_send_raw_packet
+
+TESTS += unit/test-dhcp-server
+
 if WISPR
 noinst_PROGRAMS += tools/wispr
 
diff --git a/unit/test-dhcp-server.c b/unit/test-dhcp-server.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..1cf9a63
--- /dev/null
+++ b/unit/test-dhcp-server.c
@@ -0,0 +1,250 @@
+/*
